// Paints the window when the picture is stale and there is no quit pending (vwi_q is 0), and shows it: the whole of it when it is stale in whole (1), only what the band of rows asked for needs when it is stale in part (2, cv_part), except that a menu, a colour grid or a combo box list of the ribbon lies over the page and a band painted alone would paint the page over it, so while one is open a stale part is painted as a whole; when the window did not take the picture the state stays stale in whole so the next frame paints again.
